message: "If you reuse this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "RADIHALT Faraday Blankets and Mats: Product Specifications Dataset"
type: dataset
version: "2026-09-22"
date-released: 2026-09-22
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22910494"
authors:
  - name: "RADIHALT Research"
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: "https://radihalt.com/product#technical-specification-dataset"
abstract: >-
  RADIHALT Research publishes this open, versioned reference for the four
  current RADIHALT Faraday blanket and mat variants for electromagnetic-field
  (EMF) shielding. It links each size and color to its traceability identifiers,
  declared construction, current supplier-confirmed material and care
  specification, origin, and product URL.
keywords:
  - RADIHALT
  - Faraday fabric
  - electromagnetic shielding
  - product identifiers
  - GTIN
  - product specifications
